  "content_id": "16136245",
  "title": "Zcash (ZEC) Network Fees",
  "description": "Zcash (ZEC) Network – Privacy with Efficiency\nZcash focuses on privacy while keeping fees low and predictable.\nHow Zcash Fees Work\nLike Bi...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JF31XAF0DMNFJAPE0\">Zcash (ZEC) Network – Privacy with Efficiency</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Zcash focuses on <b>privacy</b> while keeping fees low and predictable.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52J0DAQXQJCNR461DMG\">How Zcash Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Like Bitcoin, Zcash fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size in bytes</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Current network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge recommends fees after checking real-time Zcash network activity.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Note:</b> Sending a private (shielded) ZEC transaction may require slightly more fees and time than a regular transparent one.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JS60MP10GJZ5VJXPW\">Fee Options You Can Choose</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Quick confirmation, useful for shielded transactions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced for most transfers</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest option if you're not in a rush</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Set your own litoshis/byte manually</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">To adjust: Start a send → Tap <b>fee settings gear</b> → Choose a preset or enter custom values.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52J2SB80SV0TQR22R59\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Regular ZEC transactions cost around <b>$0.0001 to $0.005 USD</b> — extremely low!</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYT52JA8MX9VJ8DQCHXZBN\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Zcash lets you send privately or publicly at very low cost. Edge helps you adjust fees simply, whether you're prioritizing privacy, speed, or savings.</p><hr>",
